        "final_content_version": 2,
        "result": {
          "passage": "On Saturday, Zoë saw a 🌱 sign near the gate. Then Zoë met Sam at the community garden. A volunteer had set aside a wooden box for their beans and asked them to learn the planting method before they began. Sam brought seeds while Zoë filled a small can at the tap. Following the demonstration, they placed each seed at the same depth and covered the row gently. They decided to share the watering work: Zoë would come on weekdays, and Sam would visit at the weekend. Zoë wrote this arrangement on a card beside the box. As they left, a light rain began to fall over the fresh soil.",
